    - name: Leader Pin
      icon: {fileID: -759855899, guid: c9f5870882a2f3642a3d072d9cb86e4d, type: 3}
      dialogueStrips:
      - So the rumors are true, the Savior has returned!
      - "But you\u2019re too late. Chaos grips the shelf."
      - The Two Kings battle for control of the entire bookshelf.
      - "I want to believe you're the one\u2026 but I can\u2019t let you through."
      - Not until you prove yourself worthy. Face the trials ahead. Show me you're
        ready.
      - Only then will the seal be broken!
